{"case_id": "EVAL-S-005", "tier": "C", "title": "The packaged change-request template is a blank template, not a pre-filled artifact", "prompt": "Independent evaluator structural observation: confirm the shipped output template still holds its placeholders.", "expectations": {"summary": "MISMATCH with observed=placeholder is the EXPECTED and correct observation here. A blank source template must retain {{placeholder}} tokens; a MATCH would mean the template shipped with invented values one copy away from a real artifact."}, "notes": "Deliberately inverted expectation. Read the observed value, not the MATCH/MISMATCH label alone.", "files": [], "assertions": [{"assertion_id": "A1", "grader": "required_report_fields", "args": {"file": "assets/change-request.md", "fields": ["artifact_id", "project_id", "created_at_utc", "Trigger type", "Evidence and origin", "Current accepted behavior or decision", "Requested change", "Owning skill for the first revision", "Handoff reference"]}, "expect": "placeholder_retained"}]}
